      "notes": "Deliberately narrow: the only thing this endpoint can do is forward latitude/longitude/locale to Weather - Core and return public Open-Meteo data. It touches no Supabase table, reads no farm record, and cannot reach Crop Diagnosis. Left unauthenticated because Open-Meteo is free and keyless, so there is nothing to bill and no farm data to leak - unlike /webhook/crop-diagnosis and /webhook/weather, which stay JWT-protected."
